{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/b/11b212e562a9670bd424a14ddd099e8ba485abdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {x(x - 1) - (m + 1)}{(x - 1)(m - 1)} = \\frac {x}{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"196\" height=\"43\" /> the roots are equal when \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1dd646f1350e707340cd441954b3eaa8b748f174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ m = 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ m =\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ m = 0\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ m =-1\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ m =-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"585\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/424922e070b354fd6c4a5a378493c811453ea773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(m-1)m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" /> gives us\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/b/e0bcd122541b34f8e8ac078283d2e688c6f742d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xm(x-1)-m(m+1)=x(x-1)(m-1)\\]\" width=\"331\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/d/06d685cb88a5d9bc74501f179a05546ffb1df13b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2m-xm-m^2-m=x^2m-xm-x^2+x\\]\" width=\"345\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/f/dafbebac279bdeba7d903968e5a92e762261894f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-m^2-m=-x^2+x\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/1/e31f52223fd65876efbe93b99e0c215e9be9dcc0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-x-(m^2+m)=0\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"19\" />\nThe roots of this quadratic are equal if and only if its discriminant\n(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/8/b583c5da82fc9dfee108cfc8bd890a63051a9dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2-4ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />) evaluates to 0.\nThis means\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e32bc768ded7d64eb4a2abc6e09530bebb9afb4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(-1)^2-4(-m^2-m)=0\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/8564107c00478b28db878c2f35cba36a7143e2c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4m^2+4m+1=0\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/e/7ee95f992bf5e816d88d91228b47c384dee014df.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2m+1)^2=0\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/481379f1f6b299dcf8f2bb3a9d6563d843eb17f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m=-\\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b